      ],
      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bpetition\\s+is\\s+allowed\\b",
          "matched_text": "petition is allowed",
          "start": 104,
          "end": 123
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "12. Without commenting anything on the merits of the case, lest it may prejudice the trial, the present petition is allowed and the petitioner is ordered to be released on regular bail on his furnishing adequate bail/surety bonds to the sat"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "07f8d2d1a97843fa91047ea7085475d7_38",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner shall also abide by the following conditions:-\n(I) The petitioner will not tamper with the evidence during the trial. (II) The petitioner will not pressurize/intimidate the prosecution witness(s)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a63a9b95d1ce40b9b23da8b1abd7c174_39",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(III) The petitioner will appear before the trial Court on the date fixed, unless personal presence is exempted."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8c4b7939074e4b08b040f4d864f812be_40",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(IV) The petitioner shall not commit an offence similar to the offence of which he is accused of, or for commission of which he is suspected."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "55d61921d4964afbac404ce5c38e8813_41",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(V) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade him from disclosing such facts to the Court or to any police officer or tamper "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "966b0f6034a040868935b7dfec5a26f2_42",
