      "text_preview": "In addition, the petitioner (or anyone on her behalf) shall prepare an FDR in the sum of Rs.50,000/- and deposit the same with the Trial Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9e5a70008c0741f583e358d755a5c11e_45",
      "summary_section": "decision",
